{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_4a33756f784a1640-1247\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《愛·回家之三代同糖》昨（16日）播出一集，劇情圍繞曾碧池（林沚羿飾）與莫希靈（潘靜文飾）爭奪「收風王」寶座而展開。曾碧池因收錯風而受到處罰，誓要收復失地的她，不惜扮成木乃伊潛入「埃及之夜」私人派對偷拍黑材料，場面極具喜感！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4a33756f784a1640-1248\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>Venus 的木乃伊造型由頭至腳用白色繃帶嚴絲合縫地包到實一實，一舉一動都十分受限，動作僵硬又論盡，再配上她古靈精怪的鬼馬表情，網民紛紛留言洗版狂讚她今次造型十足驚喜：「繃帶咁新鮮」、「好鬼馬呀」、「Venus做戲其實唔錯」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_4a33756f784a1640-1248\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9cf7e72f-aae9-4f0f-bcb7-38d0e4b89604.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20264AqHrik0V41789635324.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9cf7e72f-aae9-4f0f-bcb7-38d0e4b89604.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb886b13-a605-41ee-90a2-de0bf9ac4615.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xLcWAclAyl1789635324.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb886b13-a605-41ee-90a2-de0bf9ac4615.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"beab2285-f7ae-447a-93a9-7257bc0e849c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026q6eg7mUcbd1789635324.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"beab2285-f7ae-447a-93a9-7257bc0e849c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_4a33756f784a1640-1249\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>Venus 接受訪問時透露，今次的木乃伊造型絕非易事，光是事前準備就要花足至少半小時。雖然看起來密不透風兼極其悶熱，但 Venus 笑言其實感覺不錯，樂天又專業的態度獲得網民一致好評。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:05.580657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}